              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neranyaki Musa o ltung'ana loo Siraeli Olaitoriani ele sinkolio ejo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Osinkolio le Miriam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore apa pee epuo mbartan e Farao o ngarrin enyena oo mbartan o lakedok lenyena loo mbartan atua enaiposha, neyau Olaitoriani ashuku inkariak e naiposha shumata ninche; kake eshomo iltung'ana loo Siraeli te nkop natoyio te mpolos e naiposha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Miriam, ina oiboni, anashe e Aron, adumu entampuri te nkaina enye; neipang inkituaak pooki aasuj ninye too ntampurini eipidipid aaranyisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neranyaki Miriam ninche ejo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkare nadua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nerikoo Musa Isiraeli dukuya aaing'uaa Enaiposha Nanyokie, nepuo olpurkel le Shuri; nepuo nkolong'i uni to lpurkel neitu etum enkare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee epuonu Mara, neitu eidim aatook enkare e Mara amu kedua, neaku etejoki ine Mara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neing'unyung'unyaki iltung'ana Musa, ejo, “Kainyoo kiok?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neishiraki ninye Olaitoriani; neitodol ninye Olaitoriani olchani, nenang'aki atua enkare nemelonu enkare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisho ninche Olaitoriani nkitanapat teine naatum aaishuyie, netem ninche te ine ejo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tinining'ining'i intae oltoilo lo Laitoriani Enkai inyi, niasiasa ina sidai too nkonyek enyena, nining'ining'i nkitanapat enyena nimbung'ubung'u pooki, nemapik hoo nabo oo nkeyaitin ntae apa natipika Ilmisiri; amu ara nanu Olaitoriani oishiunye intae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ninche aapuonu Elim, ine apa netii nchorroi tomon o are e nkare, o ltuka ntomoni naapishana, neitayu ilng'oborri te ine te mbata e nkare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
